From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: refresh keyboard backlight capabilities after hotplug

Refresh the existing UPower keyboard interface after device, name-owner and
brightness notifications. Cancel stale asynchronous replies and preserve the
requested brightness, including zero. Unavailable keyboards expose -1 and no
brightness steps. Do not add keyboard properties to the screen interface.

Source: https://github.com/Cryolitia-Forks/Project-SunUEFI/commit/f46280a0e01ebeae40ca2d837a11cd431c2e46b5
